      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While this could be added two issues are that:\nA) The world needs to be able to force avatar performance of `medium` or better\nB) The world needs to be large enough and have seporate sections so that only say 10 users are in one area which some good map makers do but many do not. Since if everyone is in one area the fps drops and too many people speaking nobody can hear anything.",
