      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Raising it to 64 is not enough, and I think raising it to 80 (160) or 160 (320) is also a good idea.\nThis is because in Japan Street, too many people gather in front of the station and not enough people go to the suburbs. (I think if there are more people, they will spread out a little more.)",
