  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-10-07T17:09:17.521Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "40 is a low and arbitrary number, I understand the true limit is 2X greater than that which is visibly set on a world, however, increasing the limit to 64 might be a reward for more professional map makers who are able to squeeze every last ounce of performance out of a map and likewise attempting to set your world to anything over 64 would have to go through the community labs approval process.",
